Grants and kill switch
Core's level: Permissive · Kill switch: on

Turn the kill switch off?
Turns are sent to the model again, in Codex and Claude panes. Messages from other agents
that waited reach Codex panes with their next turn (turning it off does not start one);
tasks held for Claude panes are sent now. Protected actions can be approved again and
grants can be issued. Revoked grants and approvals do not come back; stopped replies and
commands do not restart.
The level stays Permissive: turning the kill switch off never lowers it.

› Back (the kill switch stays on)
  Turn the kill switch off

↑/↓ choose · enter confirm · esc cancel, nothing changes
